OL,3,ATwenty-seven people rescued from
OL,4,Arollercoaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have rescued 27 people who
OL,7,Fwere stuck on a rollercoaster for up to
OL,8,Fthree hours.
OL,10,FSuffolk Fire and Rescue Service said it
OL,11,Fwas called to the Wipeout ride at
OL,12,FPleasurewood Hills in Lowestoft at
OL,13,F13:36 BST.
OL,15,FAn eyewitness described what appeared
OL,16,Fto be a power cut affecting multiple
OL,17,Frides at the attraction, and video
OL,18,Ffootage showed the moment the carriages
OL,19,Fcame to a stop about 15m (49ft) in the
OL,20,Fair.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
