OL,3,ATwenty-seven people rescued from
OL,4,Arollercoaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FPleasurewood Hills said it was
OL,7,F"incredibly grateful for the way [the
OL,8,Friders] handled" the situation and to
OL,9,Ftheir families for their "understanding
OL,10,Fand patience".
